GRAPH <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Actor_TinaTeam> {
  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Actor_TinaTeam> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Actor_TinaTeam> ;
    narr:childCount "70"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "e3c75c2df1a4d6b8ce07850fdf733affe72074b3" ;
    narr:narration """Tina Team's profile spans four dated movements. The first frames [the four-site rollout and the site nobody wants to touch](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_5), argues [why a double cutover is a different class of problem](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_15), and pins [a hard two-week number on the soak](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_17) grounded in [the spring pilot's exception queue](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_19), held as [evidence-first over speed-first](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_22). The second inverts it: she opens by [correcting herself at the top rather than burying it](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_1), [retracts the two-week soak outright](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_3), explains [the re-analysis that found the old number was measuring a retired weekly job](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_5) — [a job gone since July, its figure attached to the site as though a property of it](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_7) — proposes [a one-week soak preserving the same margin](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_9) while holding [the sequencing itself doesn't move](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_11), names [defensible over conservatively-for-the-wrong-reason](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_14), counts [the three-week programme cost](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_17), notes [the flaw would have surfaced at the first site anyway, and worse](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_24), and commits to [writing it up the same day](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_22). A third thread opens onto legacy wind-down: [she'd assumed they'd just keep paying the vendor to leave it running](narr:Expr_5HalyardLegacyArchive20260922_6), probes [how long the archive gets held](narr:Expr_5HalyardLegacyArchive20260922_19), and decides [the retention question belongs in the vendor exit conversation, not after it](narr:Expr_5HalyardLegacyArchive20260922_24). The fourth carries the correction into written review: she files [a review comment retracting her own two-week call](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_9), restates [the log re-analysis behind it](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_10) and [the retired-job finding](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_11), re-proposes [the one-week soak with the same margin](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_12), reaffirms [defensible over imaginary conservatism](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_6), and adds a new decision — [the one-week soak should name who signs off the second site before it starts](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_30) — alongside [the sequencing question the review poses](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_28). A parallel set of children carries the same words a second time, [quoted inside another reviewer's comment on the same position](narr:Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_19) — her retraction, her log re-analysis, and her sign-off framing [that the sequencing is right and only the number was wrong](narr:Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_38) appear there as quoted material, voiced by her but riding in someone else's review. Around the spine runs a facilitator's register — [terse openers and closers](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_2), short acknowledgments ([\"That's the question.\"](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_7), [\"I'm with you on that.\"](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_9)), a blunt reality-check on [nobody deciding off stale counts](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_29), and [easy concession when a proposal lightens site-team load](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_41). A separate child records [a review acceptance act, relayed through Claude's report](narr:Expr_3ReviewEvents70102_2) — her signature on a decision, not her own voiced argument.""" ;
    narr:reaction """The spine itself didn't move — the four movements and the correction arc all still hold. What's new is a doubling: her retraction and re-analysis now also appear [quoted inside another reviewer's comment](narr:Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_19), so the profile carries her words in two provenances, and the old narration's single provenance assumption no longer holds. The [sign-off framing that only the number was wrong](narr:Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_38) is newly visible in that second set, sharpening the retraction-without-sequencing-change shape the profile already had.""" ;
